<title>SWITZERLAND: ABB AG raises 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>ABB AG raises 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calender 1996 vs 1995:</p>
<p>		   (million Swiss francs, unless stated)</p>
<p> Div bearer share, Sfr	38		  vs 30</p>
<p> Div registered share, Sfr  7.60		vs 6.00</p>
<p> Net income		     783		 vs 822</p>
<p> Net per bearer share, Sfr  85.40	     vs 90.20</p>
<p> Net per reg'd share, Sfr   17.08	     vs 18.04</p>
<p>NOTE -- Full name is ABB AG, formerly known as BBC</p>
<p>Brown Boveri AG. ABB AG is a holding company whose main asset is</p>
<p>its 50 percent interest in ABB Asea Brown Boveri AG.</p>
<p>The other 50 percent of ABB is owned by Sweden's ABB AB,</p>
<p>formerly ASEA AB.</p>
</text>
